<title>USA: Performance Nutrition files for Chapter 11.</title>
<headline>Performance Nutrition files for Chapter 11.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Performance Nutrition Inc said it filed to reorganize under Chapter 11 of the Bankruptcy Code.</p>
<p>The company filed in the U.S. Bankruptcy Court in Dallas. It said it filed to seek relief from ongoing litigation.</p>
<p>In October, the company's shareholders filed a class action lawsuit against the company, alleging misrepresentation of material information about the company's business outlook.</p>
<p>The company's shares are trading around $0.125 each.</p>
